Feature: <capability>
  # Contract: <version/path; existing rule ID when one exists>
  # Oracle: <independent decision, external contract, or justified property>
  # Boundary: <caller/API/event/output boundary where the result is observed>
  # Evidence: proposed example | existing record <path/link>
  # Existing record should state command/check, input state, result, and limits.
  # Evidence is optional while drafting; do not create a separate evidence ledger.
  # Include success/rejection cases where required; label permitted outcomes as illustrative.

  Rule: <existing rule ID or rule summary>

    Scenario: <positive or meaningful negative behaviour>
      Given <domain state>
      When <one material event>
      Then <observable result at the boundary>
      And <observable invariant or prohibited effect when relevant>

  # Question: <case whose expected result remains unresolved; do not encode it as a Then>
  # Deferred: <independent behaviour outside this increment>
